    "title": "Reviewed Department of War organization hierarchy",
    "authorityBoundary": "Only relationships explicitly supported by cited official organization sources are promoted. Department of War is retained as a time-aware secondary title while Department of Defense remains the statutory legal name. Acquisition-system organization paths remain separate source-declared taxonomy and are not treated as command hierarchy.",
    "coverageStatement": "Reviewed coverage includes principal staff organizations, all military departments and services, all eleven unified combatant commands, selected defense agencies, major service commands, and deeper Navy acquisition-command structure. Omission does not imply that an organization is outside the department."
